otential for long-lived in vivo protein secretion, which can be modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":222138,"global_rank":189458},{"name":"JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","owner":"JeremyPVargas","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This tool models risk analysis of assets in a single DataFrame. The analysis includes risk-return metrics such as daily returns, standard deviation, Sharpe ratio and beta. Assets are evaluated using rolling statistics to track risk-reward behavior over time","topics":[],"score":222138,"global_rank":189462},{"name":"hashem20/billups","owner":"hashem20","html_url":"https://github.com/hashem20/billups","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222138,"global_rank":189499},{"name":"allisoncstafford/seattle_pets_blog2","owner":"allisoncstafford","html_url":"https://github.com/allisoncstafford/seattle_pets_blog2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Exploring hypothesis testing through the lens of Seattle pet (registered) ownership. This is the code that accompanies the blog: ","topics":[],"score":222136,"global_rank":189503},{"name":"DimpleBapna/Recommender-System","owner":"DimpleBapna","html_url":"https://github.com/DimpleBapna/Recommender-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222136,"global_rank":189513},{"name":"DimpleBapna/Spam-Detection-Filter","owner":"DimpleBapna","html_url":"https://github.com/DimpleBapna/Spam-Detection-Filter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222136,"global_rank":189514},{"name":"DimpleBapna/Finance-Data-Project","owner":"DimpleBapna","html_url":"https://github.com/DimpleBapna/Finance-Data-Project","s